# Keep alignments, treefiles, consensus trees and IQ-TREE reports. Exclude the
# bulky intermediates that can be regenerated by re-running the build scripts,
# following the convention set out in issue #12.

# IQ-TREE checkpoints and model files -- the bulk of the output
*.ckp.gz
*.model.gz

# derived matrices and starting trees, all recomputed on any re-run
*.bionj
*.mldist
*.splits.nex
*.uniqueseq.phy

# duplicate of the IQ-TREE .log
*.iqtree.stdout

# per-locus gather intermediates
gene_trees/work_*/

# wrapper build logs (the IQ-TREE .log files are kept for provenance)
build_*.log
rebuild_*.log
resume_*.log
*.mafft.log
